  "body": "All Agents Welcome!!!\r\n\r\nA stunning family home that perfectly combines space, comfort, and modern living. \r\n\r\nThis impressive property boasts 5 spacious bedrooms and 4 well-appointed bathrooms (including 3 ensuites), 2 living areas, making it ideal for larger families or those who love to entertain. The generous layout ensures everyone has their own space while providing ample room for gatherings and celebrations.\r\n\r\nSet on a substantial approx. 643 sqm land area, this home features a building area of approx. 236 sqm, offering plenty of room for both indoor and outdoor activities. A wide North facing flat backyard & feature high ceiling front entrance.\r\n\r\nThe layout is extremely functional, providing ample space throughout & also plenty of room outside via multiple external access points from both bedrooms & the main living. It also comes with an central air conditioning system for all season comfort.\r\n\r\nLocated in the desirable Red Beach area, this property is close to local amenities, schools, and stunning beaches, making it perfect for families and beach lovers alike.\r\n\r\nIt is zoned for top local schools including Red Beach School & Whangaparoa College. It is also handy to non zoned schools Stella Maris Primary School & Kingsway School.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional home is marketed by a Deadline Sale, providing you with the opportunity to make it your own. Don't miss out on this rare find - contact James 027 445 9999 today to arrange a viewing and discover all that 60 Symes Drive has to offer!",
